{"title": "Three Reads, Under Thirty", "type": "Speed cheat sheet", "hooks": ["Three chart reads in under thirty seconds. Keep up.", "Name three real charts in thirty seconds. Ready?", "A pattern, a candle and a trend, in thirty seconds."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Three chart reads in under thirty seconds. Keep up.", "text": "3 reads, 30 seconds", "chart": 0, "win": [0, 94], "show": 69}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "1. Rising channel", "vo": "One: a rising channel, which points up. A close above the trigger completed it, and it reached its measured move.", "win": [0, 94], "reveal_to": 94, "carry": true, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 91.46, "label": "Trigger", "tone": "trigger"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 90.46, "label": "Wrong if closed past", "tone": "stop"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 92.97, "label": "Measured move", "tone": "target"}]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 1, "head": "2. Hammer", "vo": "Two: a hammer. A long lower wick after a fall. But ten candles later the price was lower. Alone, it's only a clue.", "cues": [{"say": "a hammer", "do": "mark", "i": 90, "label": "A", "side": "low", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "ten candles later", "do": "reveal", "to": 100}], "win": [20, 102], "show": 90}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 2, "head": "3. Uptrend", "vo": "Three: an uptrend. Read it from the swing points: higher highs and higher lows. The first lower low is the first warning.", "win": [20, 115], "reveal_to": 115, "carry": true, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "mark", "i": 68, "label": "Hi", "side": "high"}, {"say": "", "do": "mark", "i": 86, "label": "Hi", "side": "high"}, {"say": "", "do": "mark", "i": 12, "label": "Lo", "side": "high"}]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Name it, then wait", "vo": "Name the shape, then wait for the close that confirms it.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Save this cheat sheet", "vo": "Save this, and practise naming them on real charts at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption"